  "id": "917f763a301259c59929cb9999b50868",
  "name": {
   "zh": "全身动作 · TRAM",
   "en": "Body Motion · TRAM"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "TRAM 是两阶段方法：让 SLAM 在有人走动的画面里也稳得住，再用场景背景定出动作尺度，解出人的全局轨迹和动作。这张卡交付全身角色 USD；摄影机可选 ViPE 解算、自己的 FBX / USD，或 TRAM 自己用 SLAM 解出的移动摄影机；选人、目标角色见各参数的提示。",
   "en": "TRAM is a two-stage method: it keeps SLAM stable in footage with moving people, then uses the scene background to set the motion's scale, solving people's global trajectories and motion. This card delivers a full-body character USD; the camera can be a ViPE solve, your own FBX / USD, or the moving camera TRAM solves itself with SLAM; see each parameter's tip for People to Solve and Target Character."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "body_video",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
